    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "> Subject: Topic for Monday's 1:1\n>\n> Hi Dr. Chen,\n>\n> I wanted to give you a heads-up before our meeting on Monday so you're not caught off guard. I'd like to talk about taking a leave of absence starting this fall to work full-time on Mathetic, the startup I've been building with Hudson Mitchell-Pullman.\n>\n> This isn't a decision to step away from the work we've started. I'm committed to finishing the TutorTrace camera-ready and the IDETrace rebuttal this summer, and I'd like to talk about how to hand off anything else responsibly.\n>\n> I'd really value your perspective on timing and on keeping the door open to coming back.\n>\n> Thank you,\n> David\n\nAdjust \"Dr. Chen\" vs \"Yan\" to however you normally address her in email."
     ]
    },
